# Documentation only: the application does not load this root file.
# Publium uses separate environment files for each deployment boundary.
#
# Frontend (public VITE_* values):
#   Copy-Item client/.env.example client/.env
#
# Backend (server-only secrets):
#   Copy-Item server/.env.example server/.env
#
# Never expose server-only DATABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# OPENAI_API_KEY, or NCBI_API_KEY through a VITE_* variable.
#
# Vercel uses the same variable names from both files. Keep VITE_API_URL
# empty so the browser calls the deployment's same-origin /api routes.
